- Flagged build: `tst_securestore` 17/17 through the Rust backend; `--autofill-smoke` 7/7
- Default build: `check-warnings` clean; `tst_securestore` 17/17; suite re-run 63 programs, 0 failures (the one `tabCookieIsolation` failure was a cookie-commit timing flake under concurrent main-lane load — passed standalone and on re-run)

